---
import Spark from './Spark.astro';
---

<section id="servicio">
  <Spark
    size={14}
    color="#1c1c1c"
    twinkle="c"
    speed={-0.18}
    baseOp={0.45}
    posStyle="top: 80px; left: 24px;"
    variant="star"
  />
  <Spark
    size={18}
    color="#c4f000"
    twinkle="a"
    speed={-0.1}
    baseOp={0.5}
    posStyle="top: 380px; right: 24px;"
    variant="star"
  />

  <div class="mono section-label">∗ EL SERVICIO</div>
  <h2 class="display section-title">Hacemos sitios web. Eso.</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">
    Dos planes claros. Pago único. Sin mensualidades, sin atadura. El sitio
    queda 100% a tu nombre.
  </p>

  <div class="plans">
    <article class="plan encendido">
      <div class="plan-header">
        <div>
          <div class="mono plan-tag">PLAN A</div>
          <div class="plan-name display">Encendido</div>
        </div>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="20" y1="2" x2="20" y2="38" stroke="#1c1c1c" stroke-width="4" />
          <line x1="2" y1="20" x2="38" y2="20" stroke="#1c1c1c" stroke-width="4" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-price">
        <span class="mono currency">USD</span>
        <span class="amount display">150 — 180</span>
      </div>
      <p class="plan-desc">
        Una página, diseño 100% a medida. Para profesionales y comercios que
        necesitan estar online sin vueltas.
      </p>
      <div class="plan-includes">
        <div class="mono plan-includes-label">INCLUYE</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Landing de una página</li>
          <li>Diseño responsive (mobile + desktop)</li>
          <li>Formulario y WhatsApp directo</li>
          <li>Optimizado para Google</li>
          <li>Dominio configurado</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="plan llama">
      <svg
        class="s-twinkle-a llama-spark"
        data-baseop="0.95"
        width="22"
        height="22"
        viewBox="0 0 40 40"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <line x1="20" y1="2" x2="20" y2="38" stroke="#c4f000" stroke-width="3.5" />
        <line x1="2" y1="20" x2="38" y2="20" stroke="#c4f000" stroke-width="3.5" />
        <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="34" y2="34" stroke="#c4f000" stroke-width="3.5" />
        <line x1="34" y1="6" x2="6" y2="34" stroke="#c4f000" stroke-width="3.5" />
      </svg>
      <div class="plan-header">
        <div>
          <div class="mono plan-tag">PLAN B</div>
          <div class="plan-name display">Llama</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-price">
        <span class="mono currency">USD</span>
        <span class="amount display">280 — 350</span>
      </div>
      <p class="plan-desc">
        Sitio extendido con varias secciones, animaciones y efectos cuidados.
        Para negocios que quieren diferenciarse visualmente.
      </p>
      <div class="plan-includes">
        <div class="mono plan-includes-label">INCLUYE</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Todo lo del plan Encendido</li>
          <li>Múltiples secciones extendidas</li>
          <li>Motion y micro-animaciones</li>
          <li>Transiciones cuidadas en scroll</li>
          <li>Hero con animación a medida</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="mono plans-disclaimer">
    ∗ NO INCLUYE: REDACCIÓN DE CONTENIDOS · FOTOGRAFÍA · MODIFICACIONES
    POSTERIORES AL LANZAMIENTO
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  #servicio {
    padding: 64px 48px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #1c1c1c;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .plans {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .plan {
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .plan.encendido {
    background: white;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .plan.llama {
    background: #1c1c1c;
    color: white;
  }

  .llama-spark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 24px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .plan-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .plan-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .plan.llama .plan-tag {
    color: #c4f000;
  }

  .plan-name {
    font-size: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .plan-price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .currency {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #4a4a48;
  }

  .plan.llama .currency {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  }

  .amount {
    font-size: 36px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .plan-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .plan.llama .plan-desc {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .plan-includes {
    border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    padding-top: 16px;
  }

  .plan.llama .plan-includes {
    border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .plan-includes-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .plan.llama .plan-includes-label {
    color: #c4f000;
  }

  .plan-includes ul {
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #1c1c1c;
  }

  .plan.llama .plan-includes ul {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .plan-includes li::before {
    content: '→ ';
  }

  .plans-disclaimer {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #4a4a48;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #servicio {
      padding: 48px 20px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .plans {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
